# Naming Rules (Strict)

## Forbidden Names
- process / handle / execute / do
- Manager / Helper / Util
- Common / Base / Misc

## Required Naming Style
- UseCase: Verb + DomainObject (e.g. CreateOrderUseCase)
- Policy: Noun + Policy (e.g. DiscountPolicy)
- Gateway: DomainObject + Gateway (e.g. InventoryGateway)
